{%- comment -%}
  Glues one-letter words to the word after them, so a title never ends a line on
  one ("Un depozit cât o / galerie" becomes "Un depozit cât / o galerie").
  Covers the one-letter words of the store's languages (ro o/a/e, pl w/z/i/o/a/u,
  cs/sk v/s/k/z/a/i/o/u, hr i/u/s/a/o, hu a). For plain-text titles only.

  Accepts:
  - text {String}

  Usage:
  {% render 'alc-nbsp', text: section.settings.heading %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{{- text
  | replace: ' o ', ' o&nbsp;'
  | replace: ' a ', ' a&nbsp;'
  | replace: ' e ', ' e&nbsp;'
  | replace: ' i ', ' i&nbsp;'
  | replace: ' u ', ' u&nbsp;'
  | replace: ' w ', ' w&nbsp;'
  | replace: ' z ', ' z&nbsp;'
  | replace: ' v ', ' v&nbsp;'
  | replace: ' s ', ' s&nbsp;'
  | replace: ' k ', ' k&nbsp;'
  | replace: ' A ', ' A&nbsp;'
  | replace: ' O ', ' O&nbsp;'
-}}
